560]],"speakerNameZh":"索爾","speakerGlyphs":[36,37],"portraitId":0,"linesZhTw":["『老是走這種小道，","　搞不好會碰上強盜喔！』"],"linesZhCn":["『老是走这种小道，","　搞不好会碰上强盗喔！』"],"linesEn":["Keep dragging us through back roads, and we're bound to run into bandits!"]},{"speaker":8,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[557,469,534,367,370,462,887,794,946,547,367,738,370],[181,865,400,568,755,529,300,584,560]],"speakerNameZh":"希莉亞","speakerGlyphs":[51,52,43],"portraitId":8,"linesZhTw":["『誰說的，這條路隱密的很，","　只有我才知道…』"],"linesZhCn":["『谁说的，这条路隐密的很，","　只有我才知道…』"],"linesEn":["Nonsense! This path is completely secluded.","Only I know about it..."]},{"speaker":1,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[557,658,370,493,651,369,616,400,98,470,342,560]],"speakerNameZh":"哈諾","speakerGlyphs":[38,39],"portraitId":1,"linesZhTw":["『看，前面好像有人呢！』"],"linesZhCn":["『看，前面好像有人呢！』"],"linesEn":["Look, seems like someone's up ahead!"]}],[{"speaker":97,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[557,605,569,659,387,903,68,162,338,180],[181,605,569,343,579,680,411,344,367,180,560]],"speakerNameZh":"盜賊頭目","speakerGlyphs":[127,128,129,130],"portraitId":97,"linesZhTw":["『你們想到賽拉村嗎？","　你們是來幹什麼的？』"],"linesZhCn":["『你们想到赛拉村吗？","　你们是来干什么的？』"],"linesEn":["Heading for Sera Village, are you?","What's your business out here?"]},{"speaker":0,"boxPos":"bottom","lines":[[557,947,605,948,536,342,346,334,949,794,342,560]],"speakerNameZh":"索爾","speakerGlyphs":[36,37],"portraitId":0,"linesZhTw":["『干你屁事！不要礙路！』"],"linesZhCn":["『干你屁事！不要碍路！』"],"linesEn":["None of your damn business! Out of our way!"]},{"speaker":97,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[557,191,252,534,386,399,950,370,437,654,400,98,944],[181,188,794,579,951,952,341,342,560]],"speakerNameZh":"盜賊頭目","speakerGlyphs":[127,128,129,130],"portraitId":97,"linesZhTw":["『首領說得沒錯，果然有人抄","　小路來偷襲了！』"],"linesZhCn":["『首领说得没错，果然有人抄","　小路来偷袭了！』"],"linesEn":["The boss was right!","They really did take the back trail to ambush us!"]},{"speaker":4,"boxPos":"bottom","lines":[[557,411,344,951,952,180,378,652,909,822,823,342,560]],"speakerNameZh":"亞雷斯","speakerGlyphs":[43,44,45],"portraitId":4,"linesZhTw":["『什麼偷襲？把話講清楚！』"],"linesZhCn":["『什么偷袭？把话讲清楚！』"],"linesEn":["Ambush? Explain yourself!"]},{"speaker":97,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[557,447,280,341,342,515,358,342,560]],"speakerNameZh":"盜賊頭目","speakerGlyphs":[127,128,129,130],"portraitId":97,"linesZhTw":["『少裝了！死吧！』"],"linesZhCn":["『少装了！死吧！』"],"linesEn":["Save the act! Die!"]}],[{"speaker":102,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[557,953,954,342,584,343,469,395,462,613,125,663],[181,125,686,180,560]],"speakerSlot":24,"speakerNameZh":"獸人","speakerGlyphs":[139,98],"portraitId":102,"linesZhTw":["『嗷嗚！…是誰在這裡大吵","　大鬧？』"],"linesZhCn":["『嗷呜！…是谁在这里大吵","　大闹？』"],"linesEn":["Awooo!... Who's making all that racket?"]},{"speaker":102,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[557,955,584,369,616,343,98,169,395,373,630,581],[181,560]],"speakerSlot":25,"speakerNameZh":"獸人","speakerGlyphs":[139,98],"portraitId":102,"linesZhTw":["『吼…好像是人類在打架。","　』"],"linesZhCn":["『吼…好像是人类在打架。","　』"],"linesEn":["Grrr... Looks like humans having a brawl."]},{"speaker":102,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[557,522,584,369,616,738,400,956,370,568,569,380],[181,373,98,447,367,151,486,533,342,560]],"speakerSlot":26,"speakerNameZh":"獸人","speakerGlyphs":[139,98],"portraitId":102,"linesZhTw":["『呼…好像很有趣，我們去","　打人少的那一邊！』"],"linesZhCn":["『呼…好像很有趣，我们去","　打人少的那一边！』"],"linesEn":["Heh... Looks like fun! Let's go beat up whichever side has fewer guys!"]},{"speaker":102,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[557,842,542,342,842,542,342,560]],"speakerSlot":27,"speakerNameZh":"獸人","speakerGlyphs":[139,98],"portraitId":102,"linesZhTw":["『贊成！贊成！』"],"linesZhCn":["『赞成！赞成！』"],"linesEn":["Agreed! Agreed!"]}],[{"speaker":102,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[557,369,65,709,342,346,844,341,342,346,844,341],[181,342,560]],"speakerNameZh":"獸人","speakerGlyphs":[139,98],"portraitId":102,"linesZhTw":["『好可怕！不玩了！不玩了","　！』"],"linesZhCn":["『好可怕！不玩了！不玩了","　！』"],"linesEn":["Too scary! I'm done! I'm out of here!"]}],[{"speaker":0,"boxPos":"bottom","lines":[[557,885,155,341,370,395,462,125,567,391,387,717],[181,634,774,386,391,820,127,342,560]],"speakerNameZh":"索爾","speakerGlyphs":[36,37],"portraitId":0,"linesZhTw":["『奇怪了，在這大陸上到處","　都遇得上強盜！』"],"linesZhCn":["『奇怪了，在这大陆上到处","　都遇得上强盗！』"],"linesEn":["Strange... Bandits seem to be crawling across every inch of this continent!"]},{"speaker":8,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[557,346,716,370],[181,903,68,162,65,428,455,536,341,342],[181,568,569,606,607,606,563,380,658,658,342,560]],"speakerNameZh":"希莉亞","speakerGlyphs":[51,52,43],"portraitId":8,"linesZhTw":["『不對，","　賽拉村可能出事了！","　我們趕快趕過去看看！』"],"linesZhCn":["『不对，","　赛拉村可能出事了！","　我们赶快赶过去看看！』"],"linesEn":["No, something must have happened at Sera Village!","We need to hurry over and check it out!"]},{"speaker":1,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[557,373,341,486,355,125,105,370,346,356,357,486],[181,559,338,180,560]],"speakerNameZh":"哈諾","speakerGlyphs":[38,39],"portraitId":1,"linesZhTw":["『打了一場大戰，不休息一","　下嗎？』"],"linesZhCn":["『打了一场大战，不休息一","　下吗？』"],"linesEn":["After such a rough fight, aren't we going to rest for a bit?"]},{"speaker":8,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[557,379,255,370,492,331,400,463,188,162,413,65],[181,401,351,536,356,357,581,806,358,342,560]],"speakerNameZh":"希莉亞","speakerGlyphs":[51,52,43],"portraitId":8,"linesZhTw":["『放心，途中有個小村落可","　以稍事休息。走吧！』"],"linesZhCn":["『放心，途中有个小村落可","　以稍事休息。走吧！』"],"linesEn":["Don't worry, there's a small hamlet on the way where we can take a breather. Let's move!"]}],[{"speaker":0,"boxPos":"bottom","lines":[[557,462,584,584,462,343,411,344,942,943,342,560]],"speakerNameZh":"索爾","speakerGlyphs":[36,37],"portraitId":0,"linesZhTw":["『這……這是什麼碗糕！』"],"linesZhCn":["『这……这是什么碗糕！』"],"linesEn":["Wh-what in the world is this junk?!"]}],[{"speaker":97,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[557,899,584,464,584,584,342,560]],"speakerNameZh":"盜賊頭目","speakerGlyphs":[127,128,129,130],"portraitId":97,"linesZhTw":["『哇…啊……！』"],"linesZhCn":["『哇…啊……！』"],"linesEn":["Waa... aaargh...!"]}]]}